<title>INDONESIA: Details of Bank Indonesia's maturing papers. [CORRECTED 02:57 GMT]</title>
<headline>Details of Bank Indonesia's maturing papers. [CORRECTED 02:57 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a breakdown of maturing central bank papers on Monday morning:</p>
<p>Central bank certificates (SBIs): 620 billion rupiah</p>
<p>    Short-term papers (SBPUs)	 : nil</p>
